---
source: crates/test-framework/src/snapshot/mod.rs
description: "Query: tpch[parameterized]_q14"
---
+---------------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
+---------------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Projection: Float64(100) * CAST(sum(CASE WHEN part.p_type LIKE $1 THEN lineitem.l_extendedprice * $2 - lineitem.l_discount ELSE $3 END) AS Float64) / CAST(sum(lineitem.l_extendedprice * $4 - lineitem.l_discount) AS Float64) AS promo_revenue                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |   Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |  Projection: sum(CASE WHEN part.p_type LIKE $1 THEN lineitem.l_extendedprice * $2 - lineitem.l_discount ELSE $3 END), sum(lineitem.l_extendedprice * $4 - lineitem.l_discount)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |   Aggregate: groupBy=[[]], aggr=[[sum(CASE WHEN part.p_type LIKE Utf8("PROMO%") THEN lineitem.l_extendedprice * (CAST(Int64(1) AS Int64) - lineitem.l_discount) ELSE CAST(Int64(0) AS Int64) END) AS sum(CASE WHEN part.p_type LIKE $1 THEN lineitem.l_extendedprice * $2 - lineitem.l_discount ELSE $3 END), sum(lineitem.l_extendedprice * (CAST(Int64(1) AS Int64) - lineitem.l_discount)) AS sum(lineitem.l_extendedprice * $4 - lineitem.l_discount)]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |     Inner Join:  Filter: lineitem.l_partkey = part.p_partkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |       TableScan: lineitem projection=[l_partkey, l_extendedprice, l_discount], full_filters=[lineitem.l_shipdate >= CAST(Utf8("1995-09-01") AS Date32), lineitem.l_shipdate < CAST(Utf8("1995-10-01") AS Date32)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |       TableScan: part projection=[p_partkey, p_type]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
| physical_plan | ProjectionExec: expr=[100 * CAST(sum(CASE WHEN part.p_type LIKE $1 THEN lineitem.l_extendedprice * $2 - lineitem.l_discount ELSE $3 END)@0 AS Float64) / CAST(sum(lineitem.l_extendedprice * $4 - lineitem.l_discount)@1 AS Float64) as promo_revenue]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |   RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(32), input_partitions=1                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |     SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |       BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |         VirtualExecutionPlan name=adbc compute_context=duckdb:file:./data/tpch.db base_sql=SELECT sum(CASE WHEN "part"."p_type" LIKE 'PROMO%' THEN ("lineitem"."l_extendedprice" * (CAST(1 AS BIGINT) - "lineitem"."l_discount")) ELSE CAST(0 AS BIGINT) END) AS "sum(CASE WHEN part.p_type LIKE $1 THEN lineitem.l_extendedprice * $2 - lineitem.l_discount ELSE $3 END)", sum(("lineitem"."l_extendedprice" * (CAST(1 AS BIGINT) - "lineitem"."l_discount"))) AS "sum(lineitem.l_extendedprice * $4 - lineitem.l_discount)" FROM "lineitem" INNER JOIN "part" ON ("lineitem"."l_partkey" = "part"."p_partkey") WHERE ("lineitem"."l_shipdate" >= CAST('1995-09-01' AS DATE)) AND ("lineitem"."l_shipdate" < CAST('1995-10-01' AS DATE)) |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
+---------------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
